    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ライブやるといつもあるだろ、関係者席\r\nあれだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ！　えっ！？\r\n誰でも呼んでいいの！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう。イルミネの関係者だけだから\r\n数の調整がこっちでできるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回は初めてのワンマンだからさ\r\nきっと呼びたい人がたくさんいるんじゃないかと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わー！　すごい！　すごいね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0220",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えー！　どうしよう！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "呼べるなら呼べるだけ呼びたい……\r\nでもそうするとすごい人数になっちゃう……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、友達多いもんなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うーん、そうだなぁ……\r\n──────",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねぇねぇプロデューサー、ふたり呼んでもいい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0454",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいけど\r\nふたりだけでいいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、家族や親戚も呼びたいんだけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "友達の中から、ふたり！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん\r\nちなみに、そのふたりに絞った理由って聞いてもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ひとりはプロデューサーも知ってるよ！\r\nわたしを２８３に応募してくれた子！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "アイドルのわたしが生まれたのは、\r\nその子のおかげだから……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ありがとー！　って伝えるために\r\n招待したいなって思って",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁなるほど……！\r\nうん、そうだな。すごくいいと思う",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうひとりの子は？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もうひとりはね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "急に連絡したら、\r\n迷惑になっちゃうかもしれないんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "強制じゃないんだ、声だけかけてみるのは\r\nありだと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "選ぶ権利はその子にあるんだからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その子、どんな子なんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "小学校の同級生だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "卒業して進路が分かれちゃったから、\r\n今は全然、連絡取ってないんだけどね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "その子にも、ありがとうって気持ちを伝えたくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "転校した日、\r\nクラスで初めて声をかけてくれた子なんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "きっとね、たくさん勇気が必要だったと思うの\r\nそれなのに話しかけてくれたのが、すっごく嬉しかったから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あの時のお礼っていうと、遅すぎるんだけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、全員呼ぶのが無理なら、このふたりかなぁって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0328",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nめぐる、ずっとこのワンマンは『お礼』って言ってたしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、とりあえずはそのふたりを挙げておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ご家族や親戚の方の名前と、\r\nふたりの名前、後で連絡してくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、わかった！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いつもは家族だけだから、直接話すだけで済んでたけど……\r\nもしかして、何か招待状みたいなのが必要？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "インビテーションカードとか！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、直接会えないなら\r\nあるといいかもしれないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、取引先に送るようなものになっちゃうから\r\nめぐるが直接連絡取るのはどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ、わたしが連絡してもいいの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫\r\n招待って言っても、関係者入口で名前言ってもらうだけだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに硬いものじゃないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "じゃあじゃあ、ワンマンが発表されたら\r\nすぐにふたりに連絡する！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004020310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふたりとも、来てくれたらいいなぁ！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300402/1003004020310"
